  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. I want to report a bad spot in the road. Edge of the pavement is crumbling at the curve, right by my house. 33 Wellington Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 33 Wellington. Is the edge breaking off into the lane, or is it more along the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Breaking off into the lane, a little. Chunks of asphalt out there. Neighbor hit it this morning, bent a rim, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Let me start a report. Can you hold one second while I pull up the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, just a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. I have photos here, I took some yesterday. Scrolling through. Yeah, got a good one of the curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. I've got the report started. Wellington Avenue, crumbling pavement edge at the curve, and a vehicle already struck it. Does that cover it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Can I get a reference number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. It's report 4471. I'll read it again, four, four, seven, one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four seven one. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A crew will look at it when they can get out there. Do you want a callback at the number you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Helena. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
